# Top items & charts organization

Read `apps/web/AGENTS.md` for the full web agent notes.

## Folders

- `components/export` — capture/share helpers only
- `components/charts/shared` — expandable container, legend, tooltip, d3
- `components/charts/dashboard` — dashboard/item charts
- `components/top/types.ts` — `TopItem`
- `components/top/views` — on-screen top items UI
- `components/top/export` — portrait export layouts

## Section comment headers

```tsx
{/* Rank */}
{/* Image */}
{/* Content */}
{/* Stats */}
```

## Export layouts

- Use `top/export` components for capture — not on-screen views or `ExpandableChartContainer`.
- Keep grid export images square; grid = 12 items (3×4), list = 15.
- Pie/bubble exports are frameless.
- Use `html2canvas-pro` via `useOffscreenExport` (not `html2canvas`).
